WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.812
Agentic coding local

00:00:01.624 --> 00:00:02.908
models your Mac

00:00:03.438 --> 00:00:04.747
Localcode is an

00:00:04.582 --> 00:00:05.855
open source agentic

00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:06.586
coding tool for

00:00:06.398 --> 00:00:07.046
the Mac

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.320
installed with one

00:00:08.131 --> 00:00:08.850
command

00:00:08.933 --> 00:00:10.053
that runs local

00:00:09.865 --> 00:00:10.784
models on your

00:00:10.596 --> 00:00:11.492
own machine

00:00:12.022 --> 00:00:13.177
It uses models

00:00:12.989 --> 00:00:14.109
like Gemma 4

00:00:13.921 --> 00:00:14.604
and Qwen

00:00:14.699 --> 00:00:16.137
with speculative drafting

00:00:15.949 --> 00:00:16.833
to keep coding

00:00:16.645 --> 00:00:17.305
fast

00:00:17.482 --> 00:00:18.437
and its model

00:00:18.248 --> 00:00:19.250
server ships with

00:00:19.062 --> 00:00:21.078
precompiled GPU kernels

00:00:21.614 --> 00:00:22.958
Only three features

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:23.736
touch the network

00:00:23.878 --> 00:00:24.915
model downloads

00:00:24.987 --> 00:00:25.906
web search and

00:00:25.718 --> 00:00:27.097
fetch and any

00:00:26.909 --> 00:00:28.147
MCP servers you

00:00:27.958 --> 00:00:28.524
add

00:00:29.046 --> 00:00:30.060
Full story on

00:00:29.871 --> 00:00:30.767
the dashboard
